to keep your eyes and ears wide open while you sail as you never know when you’ll come across an alligator or other rare species\n\n\n## About The Airboat\nYoung or old, everybody favors an airboat ride to the Everglades. And why not, an airboat is perhaps the best transportation choice that takes you to this **eco-wonderland** and helps you explore its riches. There’s nothing like getting the sweet fragrance of this marshland when you take a ride through its dense mangroves. Included is a show by the Indian Natives of Florida. Learn and see their culture, foods, hunting techniques and much more. Truly an awesome way to see and enjoy a whole new world. Don’t miss out on this unique experience that you can only capture on this tour. Wonderful learning and exciting experience for all ages alike.\n\n##What to Bring\n\n- Comfortable clothing & shoes\n- License or valid ID\n\n## Meeting location\n305 Lincoln Road Miami Beach", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Arrival\nPlease arrive 15 minutes early! Please meet us at 305 Lincoln Road, Miami Beach.\n\n##What to Bring\n\n- Comfortable clothing & shoes\n- License or valid ID", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "$45 • 3 Hour • All Ages • Wildlife Sightings", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/miamibeachwelcomecenter/items/132331/images/1204562/", "pk": 1204562, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WKQAWo7UTryARUKtiHrn", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WKQAWo7UTryARUKtiHrn", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/miamibeachwelcomecenter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/miamibeachwelcomecenter/items/132331/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WKQAWo7UTryARUKtiHrn", "